# Trivy waivers for the Sanctifier container images.
#
# Every CRITICAL/HIGH finding fails .github/workflows/docker-scan.yml and the
# release image gate unless it is listed here. Each waiver needs:
#
#   - a justification comment directly above it (why it is not exploitable
#     here, or why no fix is available yet),
#   - the tracking issue,
#   - an expiry, so the waiver is re-reviewed instead of living forever.
#
# Format (Trivy re-reports the finding once `exp:` has passed):
#
#   # <package>: <why this is accepted> — tracked in #<issue>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# No waivers are currently needed: the production image is distroless/static
# with a statically linked binary (see docs/docker.md).
